  "title": "One-Pan Chicken, Sausage, Peppers, and Potatoes",
  "description": "One-pan chicken, sausage, peppers, and potatoes is the stovetop version of Chef John&#39;s popular roasted recipe, but made quick and easy for weeknights.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
